#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE9702 expect=violation domain=TX
# Rule:Description: FDA-SE9702 — the Required key SETCD is not populated.
#note "SETCD blank -> violation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of SETCD."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TX
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col SETCD type=Char
col TXSEQ type=Char
col TXPARMCD type=Char
col TXPARM type=Char
col TXVAL type=Char
---
S1      | TX     |       | 1     | TRTDOS   | Treatment Dose | 10
---
